--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PATH RECONCILIATION (documented — NOT silent drift, covenant #9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The prompt's literal output path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/` is NOT
a compiled source root in this repo. project.yml compiles the app target from
`Sources/`, the unit-test target from `Tests/Unit/`, and i18n from
`Localization/Localizable.xcstrings`. A file under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/...`
would never be seen by `xcodebuild build test`, i.e. it would be dead, unverified
code (a "stub as final", covenant #4). To produce a REAL building + testable
artifact the surface was placed in the actual compiled tree, grouped as a
dashboard-widgets feature:
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/Widgets/EnergyStatsWidget.swift
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/Widgets/EnergyStatsWidgetContent.swift
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/Widgets/EnergyStatsWidgetData.swift
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/Widgets/EnergyStatsWidgetLayout.swift
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/Widgets/EnergyStatsWidgetModel.swift
  apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Widgets/EnergyStatsWidgetTests.swift

