--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY / ACCEPTANCE NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Data binds the shared `EnergyStore.energyStats` holder (P1/S8) via
  StateHolderModel → LoadableState<EnergyStatsProjection>; no HTTP in the view.
- Raw KMP JsonElement decoded via String(describing:)+JSONSerialization (same
  technique as SharedLiveStreamProvider).
- States reproduced: loading (skeleton), empty, error (TSQueryError+retry),
  stale (TSFreshnessIndicator chip), offline (cached value + TSBadge chip), plus
  compact (1xN big number) / standard (2x4) / wide (3x4+) layouts.
- i18n: all strings via `widget.energyStats.*` LocalizedStringKeys added to the
  P1/S10 catalog (16 keys; en + ar/he placeholders). No English literals in code.
- A11y: per-tile combined VoiceOver elements (label+value+unit), container label,
  chart accessibilityLabel, hidden decorative icons; Dynamic Type via tokens;
  Reduce-Motion respected by the shared TS components.
- Diagnostics: `view.opened` emitted on appear through the injected
  DashboardWidgetTelemetry seam with surface slug "EnergyStatsWidget" (P1/S11).
- Registry: id `energy-stats`, default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40, with a clamp()
  enforcing the bounds — verified by tests.
- Tests (20): adapter (full payload / null-safety / raw-token / non-object /
  numeric coercion), presentation per-state, registry + clamp, formatters,
  KPI layout (a11y label/value presence), telemetry seam.

